ous sounds, usually unwanted or unpleasant.","dna16":"8800094547000826","ex":["He knew that it was trash day, when the garbage collectors made all the noise."],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:8","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"18:1","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["uncountable"]},{"def":"Any sound.","dna16":"8800094547000925","ex":["The sudden noise made everyone jump.","She crept up behind him not making a noise."],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:9","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"Sound or signal generated by random fluctuations.","dna16":"8800094547001022","ex":[],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:10","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"Any part of a signal or data that reduces the clarity, precision, or quality of the desired output.","dna16":"8800094547001121","ex":["signal-to-noise ratio"],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:11","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"34:1,44:1,59:1","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"Variation or deviation generated by random fluctuations.","dna16":"8800094547001220","ex":[],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:12","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"Unwanted fuss or bustle; useless activity.","dna16":"8800094547001329","ex":[],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:13","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":["cacophony","clamour","clash","commotion","din","disquiet"],"tags":["broadly","countable","figuratively","uncountable"]},{"def":"The measured level of variation in gene expression among cells, regardless of source, within a supposedly identical population.","dna16":"8800094547001428","ex":[],"id":"wikt:noise:noun:14","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"21:1,34: